      "date": "2026-01-02T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "Cyber Media (India) Limited (NSEI:CYBERMEDIA) cancelled the acquisition of Cyber Media Research & Services Limited (NSEI:CMRSL)",
      "body": "Cyber Media (India) Limited (NSEI:CYBERMEDIA) agreed to acquire Cyber Media Research & Services Limited (NSEI:CMRSL) on September 30, 2025.\n\nThe deal has been approved by the board of Cyber Media (India) Limited. The transaction is subject to approval by shareholders and creditors of both companies, National Company Law Tribunal including approvals from Stock Exchanges or such other competent authority as may be directed by the NCLT. The transaction has been approved by Audit Committee and Independent Directors’ Committee, the Board of Directors of Cyber Media (India) Limited.\n\nCyber Media (India) Limited (NSEI:CYBERMEDIA) cancelled the acquisition of Cyber Media Research & Services Limited (NSEI:CMRSL) on January 2, 2026.",
